---
import WysDecor from '../../../components/WysDecor.astro';
import WysShelf from '../../../components/WysShelf.astro';
import WysStories from '../../../components/WysStories.astro';
import WysFrame from '../../../components/WysFrame.astro';
import WysHero from '../../../components/WysHero.astro';
import WysPackage from '../../../components/WysPackage.astro';
import WysWorksheet from '../../../components/WysWorksheet.astro';
import WysKit from '../../../components/WysKit.astro';
import WysFaq from '../../../components/WysFaq.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import {packages} from '../../../data/wys-packages.js';
import {WYS_ROOT} from '../../../data/wys.js';
---
<WysFrame current="inside" title="Look Inside WYS | Two Complete Worked Examples" description="Explore two complete WYS content examples: three photographs, three Pins, three Instagram slides, a full article, product records and copy for each look." ogImage={packages[0].photos[1].src.src}>
 <WysHero look={0}><p class="wys-ribbon">Inside the While-You-Sleep Storefront™</p><h1>Five Amazon finds.<br/><em>See everything built around them.</em></h1><p class="wys-lede">Open two worked examples and follow each shopping idea from the selected products to styling images, a full article, Pinterest Pins and an Instagram carousel.</p><p>See the pictures <strong>and</strong> the words: the article, captions, Pin titles, descriptions and product records.</p><a class="wys-button" href="#choose-package">Open the complete examples ↓</a><p class="wx-hero-note">Explore the workflow now. Customer checkout and delivery remain on hold.</p></WysHero>
 <WysShelf inside/><div class="wx-ticker"><span>SELECT THE PIECES</span><span>STYLE THE LOOK</span><span>MAKE THE CONTENT</span><span>CHECK THE DESTINATIONS</span></div>
 <WysStories inside/>
 <div class="wys-wrap wx-packages">{packages.map((e,i)=><WysPackage example={e} number={i+1}/>)}</div>
 <section class="wx-process-band"><div class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-centered"><p class="wys-label">One product selection does more of the work.</p><h2>This is the part you shouldn’t have to reinvent for every post.</h2><p>The products give the visuals their direction. The visuals help tell the story. The article explains the look. The Pins and carousel introduce it.</p><p>WYS is designed to give you a repeatable way to create those pieces around your own shopping ideas.</p><p>Your theme changes. Your products change. You still have a process to follow.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-paper-strip"><div><h2>What these examples show</h2><p>These are prepared content examples. Their affiliate destinations and social publication remain pending; they do not demonstrate a completed customer automation run.</p></div><div><p>AI-generated styling inspiration. Retail products may differ; check the actual listing photographs, contents and measurements. Flowers, furniture, artwork, clothing and other props are styling extras.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-last-call"><h2>Imagine your own version.</h2><p>An outfit. A dorm-room refresh. A seasonal table. A corner of your home worth sharing.</p><p>Start with the products and build the content around the idea.</p><div class="wys-actions"><a href={WYS_ROOT} class="wys-button">Explore the WYS system →</a><a href={WYS_ROOT+'/waitlist'} class="wys-text-link">Get The Weekly Edit →</a></div></div></section>
</WysFrame>
